[2K[0m]8;; [38;5;109m- [39mRestored the literal [38;5;109mWorking[39m text shimmer on turn start by supplying the generated working indicator options.        [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;;                                                                                                                        [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;; [38;5;222m[1m### [22m[39m[38;5;222m[1mRemoved[22m[39m                                                                                                            [0m]8;;
