[2K[0m]8;;                                                                                                                        [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;; [38;5;109m- [39m[38;5;109m/gpt-account[39m manages OpenAI Codex OAuth accounts the way [38;5;109m/claude-account[39m manages claude-sdk-oauth ones: [38;5;109madd[39m runs an  [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;;   interactive Codex login and stores the new account beside the existing ones, [38;5;109mremove <name>[39m, [38;5;109mpin <name>[39m and [38;5;109munpin[39m     [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;;   select which account is used, and the bare command lists every stored account with its source, availability and pin  [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;;   state without printing token material.                                                                               [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;; [38;5;109m- [39mRPC clients that send [38;5;109mmedia_placeholders[39m in [38;5;109mset_client_info[39m now receive inline tool-result images as [38;5;109mimage_ref[39m       [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;;   placeholders shaped with [38;5;109mmimeType[39m, [38;5;109mbyteLength[39m and a [38;5;109m{ toolCallId, contentIndex }[39m reference, and can retrieve an      [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;;   omitted image through the [38;5;109mget_media[39m command; default clients remain byte-identical, while classic stdio mode is not  [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;;   covered. This prevented inline image tool results from overflowing a desktop client's socket queue.                  [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;;                                                                                                                        [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;; [38;5;222m[1m### [22m[39m[38;5;222m[1mChanged[22m[39m                                                                                                            [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;;                                                                                                                        [0m]8;;
