[2K[0m]8;; [38;5;109m- [39mClaude (Fable 5/5.1, Opus 4.5-4.8/5), Kimi (K2.6/K2.7/K3), and GPT-5.6 presets now carry an execution-tooling        [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;;   stance: when the [38;5;109meval[39m tool is selected, multi-call steps are routed through one code cell with maximal parallel      [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;;   batching and real control-flow code; when [38;5;109mmonitor[39m is selected, every wait on a long-running command, child task, or  [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;;   detached cell is a subscription instead of a sleep or poll. Wording is tailored per family and renders only for      [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;;   tools the session actually has.                                                                                      [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;;                                                                                                                        [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;; [38;5;222m[1m### [22m[39m[38;5;222m[1mChanged[22m[39m                                                                                                            [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;;                                                                                                                        [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;; [38;5;109m- [39mDropped [38;5;109m.codegraph[39m from the omo local-update fingerprint's excluded roots; the omo product removed its CodeGraph     [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;;   integration, so that directory is never created.                                                                     [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;;                                                                                                                        [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;; [38;5;222m[1m### [22m[39m[38;5;222m[1mFixed[22m[39m                                                                                                              [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;;                                                                                                                        [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;; [38;5;109m- [39mTwo concurrent shared-host starts for one socket no longer fail with a raw [38;5;109mdatabase is locked[39m: the ensure-lock wait  [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;;   now covers the whole host startup critical section (probe, incompatible-host stop, spawned-host readiness) instead   [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;;   of ten seconds.                                                                                                      [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;; [38;5;109m- [39mMulti-session socket hosts deliver agent events only to connections attached to the session; targeted responses and  [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;;   dialog extension UI requests remain requester-only, while other extension UI state reaches attached connections.     [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;;   [38;5;109mRpcClient[39m drops foreign session events while lease-less and buffers own pre-lease startup events during              [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;;   [38;5;109mopen_session[39m.                                                                                                        [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;;                                                                                                                        [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;; [38;5;222m[1m### [22m[39m[38;5;222m[1mNew Features[22m[39m                                                                                                       [0m]8;;
[2K[0m]8;;                                                                                                                        [0m]8;;
